Prerequisites (checklist)
AWS account and console access with permission to create IAM roles, S3/ECR, CodeBuild, CodePipeline (or a user with Admin permissions while learning).

Your Spring Boot project in a Git repo (GitHub / CodeCommit / Bitbucket). Project should build with mvn clean package and produce target/*.jar.

