Common troubleshooting tips
Build fails: “command not found” (mvn/java) — make sure the managed image supports the runtime or use runtime-versions in buildspec. 
AWS Documentation

Permission errors (sts:AssumeRole / s3 access / ecr access) — check the CodeBuild service role trust policy and attached permissions (allow codebuild.amazonaws.com to assume role). 
AWS Documentation

Large Docker builds time out or run out of memory — increase compute type in CodeBuild (e.g., BUILD_GENERAL1_LARGE) or use multi-stage Dockerfile. 
AWS Documentation

